<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Situational moodlet for wielding a UMW_BloodStained weapon: ONE def, TWO worker-routed stages —
       stage 0 the -2 penalty for ordinary pawns, stage 1 the +3 bloodlust relish — mirroring Anomaly's
       UnnaturalDarkness (a single situational def whose worker picks between opposite-sign stages).
         • Why one def, not a penalty def + a requiredTraits buff def (the original shape): situational
           thoughts are CREATED even when nullified (SituationalThoughtHandler.TryCreateThought calls
           CanGetThought with checkIfNullified=false, verified by decompile), and the needs tab draws
           every Active situational thought — GetAllMoodThoughts filters MoodOffset()==0 rows for
           MEMORIES only. So a bloodlust pawn saw two same-label rows: the +3 buff AND the
           Bloodlust-nullified penalty as a grey 0. One def = one row, whichever sign it takes.
         • Bloodlust is routed by the WORKER (ActiveAtStage(1)), never listed in nullifyingTraits — a
           nullifier zeroes the whole def, relish stage included.
         • nullifyingTraits — the hardened feel nothing (Psychopath, + VTE Desensitized/World-weary as
           MayRequire items so the def loads cleanly without Vanilla Traits Expanded). They still see a
           vanilla-standard grey "0" row with a "nullified" tooltip — same as a psychopath's
           ColonistLeftUnburied. Known trade: Bloodlust + a nullifier (psychopath, hemogenic) reads
           nullified-0 rather than +3 — numbness wins over relish.
         • nullifyingGenes — hemogenic gene-carriers (Biotech sanguophages etc.) are inured to blood,
           so the Hemogenic li is MayRequire-gated on Biotech, exactly like vanilla ColonistLeftUnburied
           gates its Anomaly nullifyingHediff. -->
  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>UMW_BloodStainedWeapon</defName>
    <workerClass>UniqueMeleeWeapons.ThoughtWorker_BloodStainedWeapon</workerClass>
    <validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
    <nullifyingTraits>
      <li>Psychopath</li>
      <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VanillaTraitsExpanded">VTE_Desensitized</li>
      <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VanillaTraitsExpanded">VTE_WorldWeary</li>
    </nullifyingTraits>
    <nullifyingGenes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">Hemogenic</li>
    </nullifyingGenes>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>blood-stained weapon</label>
        <description>I'm carrying a weapon caked in dried blood. Its reek, and the thought of what it's done, turn my stomach.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>blood-stained weapon</label>
        <description>I'm carrying a weapon caked in the blood of those I've cut down. Its reek, and the thought of what it's done, thrill me to the core.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
